	></p><p class=MsoNormal><b>Friday 14<sup>th</sup> March 2025 - 19:00 to 21
	:00 GMT</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><b>Saturday 15<sup>th</sup> M
	arch 2025 - 08:00 to 16:00 GMT<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&
	nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal><u>Please join the summit using the fol
	lowing details</u>:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=MsoNormal>Meeting URL:&nbsp\;<a
	 href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://discussprostate.com?video&amp\
